  h1: "关于我们",
  description: "DinWeys是张家口鼎威生物科技有限公司在中国的注册商标。, 有限公司.",
  canonical: "/zh/about-us/",
  author: " ",
  date: "2024-09-02",
};
const hreflang = "<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"zh\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/zh/about-us/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/about-us/\" /> <link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://dinweys.com/about-us/\" />";
---
<BaseLayout title={page.title} hreflang={hreflang} description={page.description} canonical={page.canonical} ogType="website" lang="zh-CN" ogImage="/images/Food-Factory-1-1024x700.jpg" author=" "  datePublished="2024-09-02" dateModified="2024-09-02">
  <article class="page-content">
    <h1 class="page-title">{page.h1}</h1>
    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-center" id="h-about-dinweys">关于丁威斯</h2><p class="has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph"><em>DinWeys是张家口鼎威生物科技有限公司在中国的注册商标。, 有限公司.</em></p><p class="has-text-align-center has-contrast-2-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph">我们已将我们的商号从 XION 更改为 DinWeys 2024</p><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Food-Factory-1.jpg" decoding="async" width="2090" height="1428" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-287" style="object-fit:cover;width:338px;height:300px" title="关于我们他冷冻薯条" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">马铃薯加工生产线</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/office-1024x768.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-238" style="object-fit:cover;width:339px;height:300px" title="关于我们他冷冻薯条" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">我们的办公室</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/Company-Building-1024x768.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-208" style="object-fit:cover;width:339px;height:300px" title="关于我们冷冻薯条" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">总部大楼</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/Production-line.jpg" decoding="async" width="1706" height="1279" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-240" style="object-fit:cover;width:360px;height:300px" title="关于我们冷冻薯条" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">在生产线上</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/1.jpg" decoding="async" width="723" height="723" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-248" style="object-fit:cover;width:273px;height:300px" title="关于我们冷冻薯条" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">齐亚博士来访</figcaption></figure></div></div><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image is-style-rounded"><figure class="aligncenter size-large is-resized"><img src="/images/2-1024x1024.jpg" decoding="async" width="1024" height="1024" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-249" style="object-fit:cover;width:267px;height:300px" title="关于我们冷冻薯条" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">坚实的合作伙伴</figcaption></figure></div></div></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><strong>丁威生物科技公司, 有限公司.</strong> 是一家由中国投资者合资设立的制造和服务企业, 新西兰, 和台湾. 虽然我们提供多样化的农业解决方案, 我们的 <strong>核心专长在于马铃薯深加工产品</strong>, 具体来说 <strong>土豆片, 冷冻薯条, 和马铃薯淀粉</strong>.</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">地理位置优越，位于张家口市, 河北省 (160距北京公里)——一个以优质农业闻名的地区——我们还利用当地资源提供高质量的产品 <strong>亚麻籽, 藜麦, 和燕麦系列</strong>. 我们采用先进的加工技术, 包括滚筒干燥, 冷冻干燥, 挤压, 和低温加工, 创造优质原料.</p><p class="has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph">在北岸设有额外的运营分支机构, 奥克兰 (新西兰), 我们有能力有效地服务全球市场. 无论您是国际一线品牌还是成长型中小企业, 我们提供稳定的, 可靠的, 以及根据您的需求量身定制的具有成本效益的成分解决方案.</p></div></div><div class="wp-block-image"><figure class="aligncenter size-full is-resized"><img src="/images/营业执照_001.jpg" decoding="async" alt="Potato Flakes | Frozen French Fries | Potato Starch | Others" class="wp-image-233" style="width:400px" title="关于我们冷冻薯条" width="7016" height="4960" /><figcaption class="wp-element-caption">丁威营业执照</figcaption></figure></div><div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex"><div class="wp-block-column has-medium-font-size is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>公司验证声明 </strong></h2><p class="wp-block-paragraph"><strong>公司名称:</strong> Zhangjiakou Dingwei Biotechnology Co., 有限公司.<br><strong>统一社会信用代码 (营业执照号码):</strong> 91130702MADY9DX57U<br><strong>海关注册号:</strong> 1307961A3J<br><strong>注册于:</strong> Zhangjiakou City, 河北省, 中国</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">我们是一家在中国合法注册和经营的生物科技公司. 您可以通过官方且值得信赖的第三方平台验证我们的商业登记:</p><ul class="wp-block-list"><li><a class="" href="https://www.gsxt.gov.cn" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">国家企业信用信息公示系统 (中国)</a></li><li><a class="" href="https://www.qcc.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Qichacha (中国商业数据库)</a></li><li><a class="" href="https://www.registerchina.com" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">注册中国网</a> <em>(非官方, 仅供参考)</em></li></ul><p class="wp-block-paragraph">我公司遵守中国所有适用的法律法规并保持透明的公司结构. 如果您需要进一步验证, 我们很乐意提供额外的文件，例如扫描的营业执照, 税务证明, 海关注册证明, 或第三方审计报告.</p><p class="wp-block-paragraph">如有任何业务验证需求，请随时联系我们.</p></div></div><p class="has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph"><a href="https://dotheygobad.com/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">Tech Mange Martin 的博客由我们团队支持 </a></p>`} />
  </article>
